! MADE TF electromagnetic benchmark - supplied Solution_EM.f (PLANE233).
! Run IN PLACE after SOLVE / FINISH in Solution_EM.f, before Solution_STR.f.
! Do not RESUME the pre-solution EM_2D.db: it still contains MESH200.
! Uses existing result file; no solution, element conversion or load changes.
! Output forces retain the model's real-constant depth scaling (SL_LENGTH).
! No additional thickness multiplier is applied.
! Inspect the output for unavailable-result warnings.
FINISH
/POST1
*GET,TBET,ETYP,1,ATTR,ENAM
*IF,TBET,NE,233,THEN
  /COM,ERROR: Type 1 is not PLANE233. Run immediately after the EM solve.
  *RETURN
*ENDIF
! *GET,TBK8,ETYP,1,KOP,8
! *IF,TBK8,NE,1,THEN
  ! /COM,ERROR: Expected Lorentz forces KEYOPT(8)=1 for supplied model.
  ! *RETURN
! *ENDIF
FILE,EM_2D,rst
SET,LAST
CSYS,0
RSYS,0
/GRAPHICS,FULL
ALLSEL,ALL
ESEL,S,TYPE,,1
ESEL,R,MAT,,1
NSLE,S,ALL
*GET,TBNE,ELEM,0,COUNT
*IF,TBNE,LE,0,THEN
  /COM,ERROR: No conductor elements selected.
  ALLSEL,ALL
  *RETURN
*ENDIF
/OUTPUT,TFBM_em_plane233,txt
/COM,Conductor-only PLANE233 benchmark. Global Cartesian results.
/COM,Units and force depth scaling follow the solved model.
SET,LIST
ETLIST,ALL
RLIST,ALL
MPLIST,ALL
NLIST,ALL
ELIST,ALL
/COM,Nodal field (averaged) and assembled nodal electromagnetic forces.
PRNSOL,B,COMP
PRNSOL,FMAG,COMP
/COM,Element-nodal field: retain discontinuities for peak comparison.
PRESOL,B,COMP
/COM,Element force resultants: FMAG is summed within each element.
ETABLE,TBFX,FMAG,X
ETABLE,TBFY,FMAG,Y
PRETAB,TBFX,TBFY
SSUM
/COM,Any unavailable-result warning invalidates the affected export.
/OUTPUT
ETABLE,TBFX,ERAS
ETABLE,TBFY,ERAS
ALLSEL,ALL
/COM,Export completed: inspect TFBM_em_plane233.txt for warnings.
